<title>UK: Toyota Motor Finance sets 200 mln stg 4-year bond.</title>
<headline>Toyota Motor Finance sets 200 mln stg 4-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   TOYOTA MOTOR FINANCE NEDERLAND</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN STG   COUPON     7.50	MATURITY    05.FEB.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.304   PAY DATE    05.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    99.904    SPREAD	+12 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC  1.40	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 8.0 PCT 2000 GILT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
